(module LED_SK6812MINI-E_ReverseMount_3.2x2.8mm (layer F.Cu) (tedit 68EB0000)
  (descr "OPSCO SK6812MINI-E reverse-mount RGB LED (LCSC C5149201), 3.2 x 2.8 x 1.78 mm. AUTHORED 2026-10-12 from studio/press/references/components/key-switches/sk6812mini-e-akizuki-rev04.pdf (OPSCO SPC/SK6812MINI-E Rev.04, PDF page 4: section 4 mechanical dimensions, section 5 pins, section 6 recommended PCB). ORIGIN is the OPTICAL CENTRE (centre of the 3.2 x 2.8 body / lens). FACE: place on the board face OPPOSITE the light direction: light exits through the Edge.Cuts cutout to the far side. As authored (F.Cu) the light goes toward the BACK of the board, so pads are drawn as the datasheet BOTTOM VIEW (pin 1 top-right, 4 top-left, 2 bottom-right, 3 bottom-left); for light toward the FRONT place the footprint on B.Cu. SOURCED: pads 1.80 x 0.82, gap between pad rows 0.68 (row centres +/-0.75), pads abut the body edge (inner edge at x=+/-1.6, total width 5.88 = 3.2 + 2 x 1.34); cutout 3.2 x 2.8; pin 1 VDD, 2 DOUT, 3 GND, 4 DIN; tolerance +/-0.1. Cutout is Edge.Cuts inside the footprint with corner reliefs because JLCPCB does not support rectangular holes/slots without rounded corners (references/fab/jlcpcb-capabilities/jlcpcb-pcb-capabilities.txt). CUTOUT CORNERS: dog-bone reliefs instead of rounded corners (so the square body corners are not clipped): a dia 1.00 circular notch at each corner, centred 0.45 mm beyond the rectangle's corner along y, i.e. at (+/-1.6, +/-1.85), so the full corner is inside the cut; straight edges stay at x=+/-1.6, y=+/-1.4. Dia 1.00 = JLC minimum non-plated slot width, drawn on the mechanical/keep-out layer (jlcpcb-pcb-capabilities.txt, Min. Non-Plated Slots; non-plated slot is made by CNC); the router bit diameter itself is not stated, so 1.0 is an inference. Notches are along y, 0.19 mm clear of the sourced pads (nearest pad corner to notch centre 0.69 > r 0.5), so no copper is cut. UNSOURCED: notch offset 0.45, courtyard; the datasheet's chamfered corner (near pin 3, mirrored here to bottom-left) is not reproduced; the sourced pads abut the cutout straight edge at x=+/-1.6; silkscreen omitted.")
  (tags "LED SK6812MINI-E RGB reverse mount C5149201 cutout")
